&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note that this is an evergreen requisition and is intended to help us build a pipeline of talented Sales Development Representatives for future opportunities at Huntress. Although there may not be an immediate opening, we’ll continue reviewing applications and may contact candidates whose experience aligns with future hiring needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
